# Supabase Configuration
# Project: GuidanceInnovations (xjmsgaegwvhgxdsvtnwk)
# Organization: globear's Org

# SETUP INSTRUCTIONS:
# 1. Copy this file and rename it to .env.local
# 2. Go to https://supabase.com/dashboard/project/xjmsgaegwvhgxdsvtnwk/settings/api
# 3. Copy the Project URL and anon/public key
# 4. Replace the placeholder values below with your actual values
# 5. For FixMyText feature: Add DEEPSEEK_API_KEY to Supabase Dashboard (Project Settings > Edge Functions)

# Your Supabase project URL (format: https://xjmsgaegwvhgxdsvtnwk.supabase.co)
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=your_supabase_url_here

# Your Supabase anon/public key (safe to use in client-side code)
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_supabase_anon_key_here

# NOTE: DeepSeek API Key
# The DeepSeek API key is NOT stored in .env.local for security reasons.
# Instead, add it to Supabase Dashboard:
# 1. Go to Project Settings > Edge Functions
# 2. Add secret: DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=your_deepseek_api_key_here
# 3. Get your key from: https://platform.deepseek.com/
